{"version":1,"content":"<p>烏克蘭軍方一支旅級部隊周一（19日）表示，利用空中無人機將一名傷兵撤離前線，稱是全球首例。</p><p>事件中的傷兵正接受治療及康復，已無生命危險。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:39:07.942832+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":68,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:05:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T17:57:45.954714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:37:49.120920+00:00","content_hash":"06503047e62489813f208e28e87859efc31bd45d5745a3dd0f662ce82f066f31","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}